{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《自然系女子旅行3》迎來濟州站的最後一集。元老級主持林映暉（暉哥）聯同梁超怡（Joey），帶領觀眾體驗兩大驚險活動，並到訪人氣文創小店享受DIY樂趣。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><strong>第一站：驚險高空飛索與香薰足浴</strong></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>超怡克服畏高，與暉哥一同挑戰高空飛索。兩人完成磅重及安全設備調校後，親身解鎖場內三條不同路線，體驗中段突如其來的爆發式加速快感：</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li></ul><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>挑戰過後，兩人隨即享受香薰精油足浴，在溫熱與香氣中放鬆緊繃的肌肉與思緒。</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>Jeju LAF</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>地址：115-1 Seongyo-ro, Jocheon-eup, Jeju-si</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>費用：韓圜₩35,000 / 約<span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>$181港幣（不含足浴）；韓圜₩42,000 / 約$</span>217港幣（含足浴套餐）</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"cb8f1206-b9b4-4ce3-98ff-933d02699f46.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026PaCzZmmwnV1785054553.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cb8f1206-b9b4-4ce3-98ff-933d02699f46.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"429be21b-4560-467e-99eb-f374fe643776.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026GzBCLN1R1P1785054558.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"429be21b-4560-467e-99eb-f374fe643776.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>第二站：50分鐘越野車（Off-Road）探險</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>兩人挺進佔地43萬平方米的Off-Road營地，體驗長達6.5公里的越野路線。路線由KRF獲獎車手親自設計，滿佈碎石與泥濘，呈現最純粹的顛簸刺激。途經海拔305米的觀景台時，天氣晴朗更可遠眺朝天、咸德、金寧、細花及城山日出峰的壯麗風光。</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>Jerazin Real Offroad</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>地址：624-4 Seonheul-ri, Jocheon-eup, Jeju-si</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>費用：每輛 韓圜₩150,000 / 約$776港幣</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b87c53a4-111c-4a46-83e1-c26c3761b156.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026mmM5I9nDQ21785054578.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b87c53a4-111c-4a46-83e1-c26c3761b156.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><strong>尾站：人氣文創小店發揮創意 DIY Totebag</strong></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>行程最後，兩人來到一間極具人氣的文創小店。店內除了有各式插畫周邊與明信片，最吸引的是DIY Totebag體驗。店家提供琳瑯滿目的立體刺繡熨布貼（如彩虹、愛心、蝴蝶結、英文字母等），兩人隨即化身設計師，發揮創意即場打造出專屬的手提袋。</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>Object Jeju Branch</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>地址：722-1 Dongbok-ri, Gujwa-eup, Jeju-si</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>費用：純棉基礎款Totebag（小） 韓圜₩20,000 / 約<span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>$103港幣；暉哥客製版 韓圜₩49,700 / 約$</span>257港幣；超怡客製版 韓圜₩51,200 / 約$265港幣</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"98b5b113-9054-4326-ab21-0a2d7633cf00.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026tBwVrg9G7p1785054597.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"98b5b113-9054-4326-ab21-0a2d7633cf00.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"0ff2cf0c-7405-4746-94bc-12b3a31a38b7.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026pJZvzx2ic21785054602.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0ff2cf0c-7405-4746-94bc-12b3a31a38b7.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-29T06:18:46.380856+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":832,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}